#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:3
msgid "Related Projects"
msgstr "相關專案"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:6
msgid "Gazebo"
msgstr "Gazebo"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Gazebo** `(gazebosim.org) <https://gazebosim.org/>`_ and its predecessor "
"Gazebo Classic are the first open source choice for 3D physics simulation of "
"ROS-based robots."
msgstr ""
"**Gazebo** `(gazebosim.org) <https://gazebosim.org/>`_ 及其前身 Gazebo "
"Classic 是基於 ROS 的機器人 3D 物理模擬的首選開源方案。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:11
msgid "Large Community Projects"
msgstr "大型社群專案"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:13
msgid ""
"Large community projects involve multiple developers from all over the globe "
"and are typically backed by a dedicated working group (cf. :doc:`The-ROS2-"
"Project/Governance`)."
msgstr ""
"大型社群專案涉及來自全球各地的多位開發者，通常由專門的工作小組支援（參閱 :"
"doc:`The-ROS2-Project/Governance`）。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:15
msgid ""
"**ros2_control** `(control.ros.org) <https://control.ros.org/>`_: Flexible "
"framework for real-time control of robots implemented with ROS 2."
msgstr ""
"**ros2_control** `(control.ros.org) <https://control.ros.org/>`_：使用 ROS 2 "
"實作的靈活機器人即時控制框架。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Navigation2** `(nav2.org) <https://nav2.org/>`_: Comprehensive and "
"flexible navigation stack for mobile robots using ROS 2."
msgstr ""
"**Navigation2** `(nav2.org) <https://nav2.org/>`_：使用 ROS 2 的全面且靈活的"
"行動機器人導航堆疊。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:17
msgid ""
"**MoveIt** `(moveit.ai) <https://moveit.ai/>`_: A rich platform for building "
"manipulation applications featuring advanced kinematics, motion planning, "
"control, collision checking, and much more."
msgstr ""
"**MoveIt** `(moveit.ai) <https://moveit.ai/>`_：一個豐富的平台，用於構建操作"
"應用，具備先進的運動學、運動規劃、控制、碰撞檢測等功能。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:18
msgid ""
"**micro-ROS** `(micro.ros.org) <https://micro.ros.org/>`_: A platform for "
"putting ROS 2 onto microcontrollers, starting at less than 100 kB of RAM."
msgstr ""
"**micro-ROS** `(micro.ros.org) <https://micro.ros.org/>`_：將 ROS 2 部署到微"
"控制器上的平台，最低只需不到 100 kB 的 RAM。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:21
msgid "Further Community Projects"
msgstr "更多社群專案"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:23
msgid ""
"The global ROS community develops and maintains hundreds of further packages "
"on top of the core ROS 2 stack. Some of them come with their own websites "
"for documentation. Your best entry point to discover these works is the "
"**ROS Index** `(index.ros.org) <https://index.ros.org/packages/>`_."
msgstr ""
"全球 ROS 社群在核心 ROS 2 堆疊之上開發並維護了數百個額外套件，其中部分套件擁"
"有自己的文件網站。探索這些作品的最佳入口是 **ROS Index** `(index.ros.org) "
"<https://index.ros.org/packages/>`_。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:27
msgid ""
"*Hint for developers:* If you maintain a ``README.md`` file in the root of "
"your package folder (which is not necessarily the root of your repository), "
"this file is rendered into the overview page of your package at `index.ros."
"org <https://index.ros.org/packages/>`_. The file may be used for "
"documenting your package and supersedes the package documentation pages in "
"the ROS Wiki from ROS 1. See the `fmi_adapter package <https://index.ros.org/"
"p/fmi_adapter/#rolling>`_ as an example."
msgstr ""
"*開發者提示：* 如果你在套件資料夾（不一定是儲存庫的根目錄）的根目錄中維護一"
"個 ``README.md`` 檔案，該檔案會呈現在 `index.ros.org <https://index.ros.org/"
"packages/>`_ 上你的套件概覽頁面中。此檔案可用於記錄你的套件，並取代 ROS 1 的 "
"ROS Wiki 中的套件文件頁面。請參考 `fmi_adapter 套件 <https://index.ros.org/p/"
"fmi_adapter/#rolling>`_ 作為範例。"

#: ../../../source/Related-Projects.rst:32
msgid "Company-driven Projects"
msgstr "企業主導專案"
